  "payload": {
    "contentHtml": "<article class=\"tw-article\"><header><strong>Neo</strong><h1>如何在 Hermes 中构建多智能体团队</h1></header><div class=\"tw-article-body\"><p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">大多数人使用一个 AI 助手，然后试图强迫它同时成为研究员、作家、程序员、项目经理和运营人员。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">那通常会起作用一段时间。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">然后个性相互模糊。情境变得混乱。记忆变得嘈杂。工作流程不再显得刻意。Hermes 为您提供了一条更好的路径：组建团队而非让单个通才超负荷工作。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Hermes 配置文件是整个系统中最被低估的功能之一。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它们不仅仅是装饰性的角色。它们是孤立的代理环境，可以分离记忆、会话、技能、个性、配置、cron 状态和网关行为。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这意味着你不仅仅是将一个助手重命名四次。你正在创建基于角色的智能体，这些智能体具有更清晰的边界和更持久的专业化。</span></p>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">要点：从单个智能体到真正的多智能体团队的跨越，始于隔离，而非更优的提示。</font></font></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">正确的思维模型</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">错误的思维模式是：“我需要一个能做所有事情的天才 AI。”</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">更好的思维模型是：“我需要一个职责明确、交接清晰且上下文污染较少的小团队。”</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">那正是 Hermes 配置文件使之成为可能的。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一种角色可以像战略家一样思考。另一种可以优先进行研究。另一种可以专注于沟通优化。另一种可以处于执行和调试模式。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">因为它们的记忆、会话和身份保持独立，每个代理可以随着时间变得更加连贯，而不是变成混乱的混合体。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Takeaway: </span><span data-text=\"true\">Hermes profiles are best understood as role boundaries for AI work, not as novelty character skins.</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">哪些配置文件实际上起到区分作用？</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这就是 Hermes 变得比普通助手设置更严肃的地方。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一个配置文件可以隔离：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">配置</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">会话</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">内存</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">技能</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">性格</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">cron 状态</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">网关状态</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这一点很重要，因为当一切都共享相同的记忆和语气时，多智能体系统会失败。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你不希望你的代码代理继承与你的研究代理或写作代理相同的默认设置、优先级和风格习惯。你希望它们之间界限清晰。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：只有当状态保持分离时，专业化才能变得持久。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">最简单的团队结构</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果你想要一个实用的起点，我已经设置了以下内容。从四个角色开始：</span></p>\n<ol><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Hermes &gt; 编排器</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Alan &gt; 研究专家</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Mira &gt; 叙事架构师</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">图灵：调试器和系统工程师</span></li></ol>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是一个强大的模式，因为它反映了实际工作。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">编排器处理规划、分解、排序和最终综合。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">研究代理收集信息源、验证声明，并将原始信息转化为可供决策的成果。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">作者将经过验证的材料转化为清晰、有条理的沟通。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工程师将计划转化为可运行的系统，进行测试、修复并生成可靠的输出。</span></p>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">核心要点：最有用的 AI 团队对应于真实的职能角色，而非随意的个性。</font></font></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">角色 1：编排者</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你的编排器配置是指挥中心。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它的工作不是亲自完成每一项任务。它的工作是确定目标、拆分工作、将任务分配给合适的专家，并综合最终结果。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这个配置文件应针对以下方面进行优化：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">规划</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">优先级排序</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">依赖管理</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">质量控制</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">综合</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">它应该以工作流的方式思考，而不仅仅是给出答案。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">核心要点：编排器是系统的流量控制器，而非瓶颈。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">角色 2：研究专家</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一个研究形象应该持怀疑态度、以来源为优先且结构清晰。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">其目的是收集证据、比较来源、标记不确定性，并区分已验证的内容与仅仅看似合理的内容。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是你想要的配置文件：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">文献综述</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">市场调研</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">产品比较</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">来源核实</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">趋势跟踪</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">关键不在于仅仅是“良好的研究”，而在于保护团队的其他成员免受错误假设的影响。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：优秀的研究型智能体能够降低整个系统中因幻觉产生的置信度。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">角色3：作者</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">写作风格应该针对清晰性、结构、可读性和受众意识进行优化。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是你将原始发现转化为</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">文章</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">简报</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">产品文案</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">线程</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">脚本</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">解释者们</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">作者不需要一直将整个研究过程或实施背景记在脑海中。作者应该接收更清晰的输入，并专注于沟通质量。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：当代理不需要同时扮演研究者和调试者的角色时，写作会变得更好。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">角色 4：构建者/调试者</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你的工程能力概述应该直接、以证据为导向且侧重执行。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是...的资料</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">开发功能</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">调试失败</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">代码审查</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">验证修复</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">运行测试</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">运营问题解决</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这个配置文件应该更关注可重复性、日志、diffs 和已验证的结果，而非广泛的叙事润色。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：当允许一个角色保持深入的技术深度时，实施质量会提高。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">使用 SOUL.md 使每个角色真实</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在多智能体设置中，最容易犯的错误之一是只更改名称。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果每个代理都有相同的潜在语气、优先级和工作风格，你就没有一个真正的团队。你拥有的只是贴了标签的克隆体。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Hermes 为你提供更坚实的基础，这一基础由 SOUL.md 定义——SOUL.md 明确了代理的本质及其行为方式。在那里，你可以塑造每个配置文件的默认身份。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">例如：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">编排器应该听起来有条理且果断</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">研究人员应该以证据为优先且持怀疑态度</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">作者应表达清晰并考虑受众</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工程师应该听起来精准且以测试为导向</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\">Then use </span><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">AGENTS.md </span><span data-text=\"true\">for project-specific context rather than identity.</span></p>\n<p><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-wrapper\" lang=\"zh-CN\"><br hidden=\"\"><font class=\"notranslate immersive-translate-target-translation-pre-whitespace immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper-theme-background immersive-translate-target-translation-block-wrapper\" data-immersive-translate-translation-element-mark=\"1\">要点：SOUL.md 创建不同的代理；AGENTS.md 为它们提供共享的任务上下文。</font></font></p>\n<h1><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">实际设置，一步步</span></h1>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是实践部分：如何从一个可运行的 Hermes 配置过渡到一个具有隔离角色的真实多智能体团队。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在这个例子中，团队是：</span></p>\n<ol><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Hermes &gt; 编排器</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Alan &gt; 研究专家</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt_insert_failed_reason=\"same_text\">Mira &gt; writer</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">图灵：调试器和系统工程师</span></li></ol>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">目标不仅仅是创建四个名称。目标是创建四个独立的 Hermes 配置文件，每个都具有自己的身份和状态。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：Hermes 中真正的多智能体配置始于角色档案，而非提示词。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">步骤 1：从一个正常运行的 Hermes 配置开始</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在创建专业代理之前，请确保您的主要 Hermes 配置已经正常运行。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这意味着：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">您的模型/提供商已配置</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你的 API 密钥或身份验证已经可以正常使用</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你的正常 Hermes 环境是可用的</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这很重要，因为构建团队的最简单方式是从一个可用的配置中进行克隆。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：从一个可用的基础开始，这样你就不必从头配置每个代理。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">步骤 2: 创建专家档案</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">通过克隆当前工作配置文件来创建每个新的配置文件。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">命令：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">hermes 配置文件 创建 alan --clone</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">hermes 配置文件创建 mira --克隆</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">hermes 配置文件 创建 turing --clone</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果你想要首先检查可用选项，运行：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">hermes 配置文件创建 --help</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">使用 --clone 会复制有用的基础配置，例如：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">配置.yaml</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">env 文件</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">灵魂.md</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">但是每个新配置文件仍然会拥有它自己的独立内存和会话历史。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：当你需要专门的代理继承你的工作配置而不共享相同的内部状态时，请使用 --clone。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">步骤 3：验证配置文件是否存在</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">创建配置文件后，确认它们确实已被创建。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">《Neo on X：“如何在 Hermes 中构建多智能体团队” / X》</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">hermes 配置文件列表</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你现在应该能看到你的新配置文件已列出。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">在磁盘上，它们应该位于：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">/home/neo/.hermes/profiles/alan/</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">/主目录/尼奥/.Hermes/个人资料/米拉/</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">/主目录/neo/.hermes/配置文件/turing/</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">您的主要 Hermes 配置文件可以保持为编排者，而其他成员可以作为专家。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：始终在继续之前验证 CLI 和磁盘上的配置文件。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">步骤 4：通过 SOUL.md 为每个配置文件赋予真实身份</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是将个人资料转化为实际智能体的步骤。每个专家个人资料都应有其专属的 SOUL.md 文件：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">/用户主目录/neo/.hermes/配置文件/alan/SOUL.md</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">/家目录/neo/.hermes/profiles/mira/SOUL.md</span></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">/主目录/neo/.hermes/配置文件/turing/SOUL.md</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">使用 SOUL.md 定义持久身份：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">语气</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">默认行为</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">优势</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">优先级</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">智能体应该避免的内容</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一个强大的分离看起来是这样的：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Hermes：规划、任务分配、综合、最终 QA</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">艾伦：证据，核实，研究深度，不确定性处理</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Mira：清晰、结构、受众意识、沟通精准</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">Turing：实现，调试，测试，可重复性，技术精确性</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这是关键区别：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">SOUL.md 定义了智能体是什么。</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">AGENTS.md 定义了共享项目上下文</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：如果仅更改个人资料名称而不修改 SOUL.md，实际上你并没有真正组建起一个团队。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">步骤 5: 将共享上下文与身份分离</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一旦每个代理配置文件都有独特的身份，就在项目级文件（如 AGENTS.md）中保留共享的操作上下文。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">用它来做类似的事情：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">代码仓库结构</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">编码规范</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工作流规则</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">工具使用预期</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">项目特定说明</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">不要在 SOUL.md 中过多加入临时项目细节。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这种分离使系统随时间保持整洁：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">身份保留在 SOUL.md 中</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">项目上下文保留在 AGENTS.md 中</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：稳定的团队需要稳定的身份和共享的上下文，而不是一个庞大的、混杂的指令块。</span></li></ul>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">步骤 6: 添加一个共享的团队参考文件</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这有助于维护一个记录人员名单以及代理如何协作的共享参考文件。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">例如：</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">/home/neo/.hermes/团队代理.md</span></span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">此文件可以描述：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每个代理的角色</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">交接规则</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">何时使用哪个配置文件</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每个成员的良好产出是什么样的</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这给你一个地方，来向自己或以后使用它的其他人解释这个系统。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：团队参考文件使多智能体设置更容易一致地运行。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">步骤 7: 直接运行每个配置文件</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">一旦配置文件存在，您可以单独调用它们。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">典型模式:</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">hermes -p alan</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">hermes -p mira</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold; font-style: italic;\">hermes -p turing</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">重要的是，每个代理都以自己的配置文件运行，并且具有隔离状态。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这意味着：</span></p>\n<ul><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">艾伦不继承米拉的写作时段</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">图灵没有继承艾伦的研究记忆</span></li><li><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">每个智能体获得更清晰的长期专业化</span></li></ul>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：好处来自于实际单独使用这些配置文件，而不仅仅是创建一次。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">将个人资料与消息关联</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">当你将配置文件与 Hermes 网关结合使用时，它们会变得更加强大。现在你的团队不再受限于单个本地终端会话。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">你可以将不同的配置文件作为不同的消息身份运行，远程监督它们，通过 Telegram 分配工作，并在聊天和任务中保持角色边界完整。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">这正是 Hermes 开始感觉不那么像单一助手，而更像一个运营系统的地方。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">要点：消息传递将本地组织功能中的代理档案转变为实时多代理控制界面。</span></p>\n<h2><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">结论</span></h2>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">如果你希望 Hermes 更强大，就别再试图让一个代理做所有事情。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">构建一个团队。</span></p>\n<p><span data-text=\"true\" data-imt-p=\"1\" data-imt-translation-only=\"1\" class=\"immersive-translate-target-translation-theme-background immersive-translate-target-inner\">从协调器开始，添加一名专家，验证交接流程，然后再进行扩展。正是在这里，Hermes 配置文件不再感觉像一个功能，而是开始感觉像基础设施。</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">Takeaway:</span><span data-text=\"true\"> the smartest multi-agent team is not the biggest one. It is the one with the clearest role boundaries.</span></p></div></article>",
    "pageContent": "大多数人使用一个 AI 助手，然后试图强迫它同时成为研究员、作家、程序员、项目经理和运营人员。\n那通常会起作用一段时间。\n然后个性相互模糊。情境变得混乱。记忆变得嘈杂。工作流程不再显得刻意。Hermes 为您提供了一条更好的路径：组建团队而非让单个通才超负荷工作。\nHermes 配置文件是整个系统中最被低估的功能之一。\n它们不仅仅是装饰性的角色。它们是孤立的代理环境，可以分离记忆、会话、技能、个性、配置、cron 状态和网关行为。\n这意味着你不仅仅是将一个助手重命名四次。你正在创建基于角色的智能体，这些智能体具有更清晰的边界和更持久的专业化。\n要点：从单个智能体到真正的多智能体团队的跨越，始于隔离，而非更优的提示。\n正确的思维模型\n错误的思维模式是：“我需要一个能做所有事情的天才 AI。”\n更好的思维模型是：“我需要一个职责明确、交接清晰且上下文污染较少的小团队。”\n那正是 Hermes 配置文件使之成为可能的。\n一种角色可以像战略家一样思考。另一种可以优先进行研究。另一种可以专注于沟通优化。另一种可以处于执行和调试模式。\n因为它们的记忆、会话和身份保持独立，每个代理可以随着时间变得更加连贯，而不是变成混乱的混合体。\nTakeaway: Hermes profiles are best understood as role boundaries for AI work, not as novelty character skins.\n哪些配置文件实际上起到区分作用？\n这就是 Hermes 变得比普通助手设置更严肃的地方。\n一个配置文件可以隔离：\n配置\n会话\n内存\n技能\n性格\ncron 状态\n网关状态\n这一点很重要，因为当一切都共享相同的记忆和语气时，多智能体系统会失败。\n你不希望你的代码代理继承与你的研究代理或写作代理相同的默认设置、优先级和风格习惯。你希望它们之间界限清晰。\n要点：只有当状态保持分离时，专业化才能变得持久。\n最简单的团队结构\n如果你想要一个实用的起点，我已经设置了以下内容。从四个角色开始：\nHermes > 编排器\nAlan > 研究专家\nMira > 叙事架构师\n图灵：调试器和系统工程师\n这是一个强大的模式，因为它反映了实际工作。\n编排器处理规划、分解、排序和最终综合。\n研究代理收集信息源、验证声明，并将原始信息转化为可供决策的成果。\n作者将经过验证的材料转化为清晰、有条理的沟通。\n工程师将计划转化为可运行的系统，进行测试、修复并生成可靠的输出。\n核心要点：最有用的 AI 团队对应于真实的职能角色，而非随意的个性。\n角色 1：编排者\n你的编排器配置是指挥中心。\n它的工作不是亲自完成每一项任务。它的工作是确定目标、拆分工作、将任务分配给合适的专家，并综合最终结果。\n这个配置文件应针对以下方面进行优化：\n规划\n优先级排序\n依赖管理\n质量控制\n综合\n它应该以工作流的方式思考，而不仅仅是给出答案。\n核心要点：编排器是系统的流量控制器，而非瓶颈。\n角色 2：研究专家\n一个研究形象应该持怀疑态度、以来源为优先且结构清晰。\n其目的是收集证据、比较来源、标记不确定性，并区分已验证的内容与仅仅看似合理的内容。\n这是你想要的配置文件：\n文献综述\n市场调研\n产品比较\n来源核实\n趋势跟踪\n关键不在于仅仅是“良好的研究”，而在于保护团队的其他成员免受错误假设的影响。\n要点：优秀的研究型智能体能够降低整个系统中因幻觉产生的置信度。\n角色3：作者\n写作风格应该针对清晰性、结构、可读性和受众意识进行优化。\n这是你将原始发现转化为\n文章\n简报\n产品文案\n线程\n脚本\n解释者们\n作者不需要一直将整个研究过程或实施背景记在脑海中。作者应该接收更清晰的输入，并专注于沟通质量。\n要点：当代理不需要同时扮演研究者和调试者的角色时，写作会变得更好。\n角色 4：构建者/调试者\n你的工程能力概述应该直接、以证据为导向且侧重执行。\n这是...的资料\n开发功能\n调试失败\n代码审查\n验证修复\n运行测试\n运营问题解决\n这个配置文件应该更关注可重复性、日志、diffs 和已验证的结果，而非广泛的叙事润色。\n要点：当允许一个角色保持深入的技术深度时，实施质量会提高。\n使用 SOUL.md 使每个角色真实\n在多智能体设置中，最容易犯的错误之一是只更改名称。\n如果每个代理都有相同的潜在语气、优先级和工作风格，你就没有一个真正的团队。你拥有的只是贴了标签的克隆体。\nHermes 为你提供更坚实的基础，这一基础由 SOUL.md 定义——SOUL.md 明确了代理的本质及其行为方式。在那里，你可以塑造每个配置文件的默认身份。\n例如：\n编排器应该听起来有条理且果断\n研究人员应该以证据为优先且持怀疑态度\n作者应表达清晰并考虑受众\n工程师应该听起来精准且以测试为导向\nThen use AGENTS.md for project-specific context rather than identity.\n要点：SOUL.md 创建不同的代理；AGENTS.md 为它们提供共享的任务上下文。\n实际设置，一步步\n这是实践部分：如何从一个可运行的 Hermes 配置过渡到一个具有隔离角色的真实多智能体团队。\n在这个例子中，团队是：\nHermes > 编排器\nAlan > 研究专家\nMira > writer\n图灵：调试器和系统工程师\n目标不仅仅是创建四个名称。目标是创建四个独立的 Hermes 配置文件，每个都具有自己的身份和状态。\n要点：Hermes 中真正的多智能体配置始于角色档案，而非提示词。\n步骤 1：从一个正常运行的 Hermes 配置开始\n在创建专业代理之前，请确保您的主要 Hermes 配置已经正常运行。\n这意味着：\n您的模型/提供商已配置\n你的 API 密钥或身份验证已经可以正常使用\n你的正常 Hermes 环境是可用的\n这很重要，因为构建团队的最简单方式是从一个可用的配置中进行克隆。\n要点：从一个可用的基础开始，这样你就不必从头配置每个代理。\n步骤 2: 创建专家档案\n通过克隆当前工作配置文件来创建每个新的配置文件。\n命令：\nhermes 配置文件 创建 alan --clone\nhermes 配置文件创建 mira --克隆\nhermes 配置文件 创建 turing --clone\n如果你想要首先检查可用选项，运行：\nhermes 配置文件创建 --help\n使用 --clone 会复制有用的基础配置，例如：\n配置.yaml\nenv 文件\n灵魂.md\n但是每个新配置文件仍然会拥有它自己的独立内存和会话历史。\n要点：当你需要专门的代理继承你的工作配置而不共享相同的内部状态时，请使用 --clone。\n步骤 3：验证配置文件是否存在\n创建配置文件后，确认它们确实已被创建。\n《Neo on X：“如何在 Hermes 中构建多智能体团队” / X》\nhermes 配置文件列表\n你现在应该能看到你的新配置文件已列出。\n在磁盘上，它们应该位于：\n/home/neo/.hermes/profiles/alan/\n/主目录/尼奥/.Hermes/个人资料/米拉/\n/主目录/neo/.hermes/配置文件/turing/\n您的主要 Hermes 配置文件可以保持为编排者，而其他成员可以作为专家。\n要点：始终在继续之前验证 CLI 和磁盘上的配置文件。\n步骤 4：通过 SOUL.md 为每个配置文件赋予真实身份\n这是将个人资料转化为实际智能体的步骤。每个专家个人资料都应有其专属的 SOUL.md 文件：\n/用户主目录/neo/.hermes/配置文件/alan/SOUL.md\n/家目录/neo/.hermes/profiles/mira/SOUL.md\n/主目录/neo/.hermes/配置文件/turing/SOUL.md\n使用 SOUL.md 定义持久身份：\n语气\n默认行为\n优势\n优先级\n智能体应该避免的内容\n一个强大的分离看起来是这样的：\nHermes：规划、任务分配、综合、最终 QA\n艾伦：证据，核实，研究深度，不确定性处理\nMira：清晰、结构、受众意识、沟通精准\nTuring：实现，调试，测试，可重复性，技术精确性\n这是关键区别：\nSOUL.md 定义了智能体是什么。\nAGENTS.md 定义了共享项目上下文\n要点：如果仅更改个人资料名称而不修改 SOUL.md，实际上你并没有真正组建起一个团队。\n步骤 5: 将共享上下文与身份分离\n一旦每个代理配置文件都有独特的身份，就在项目级文件（如 AGENTS.md）中保留共享的操作上下文。\n用它来做类似的事情：\n代码仓库结构\n编码规范\n工作流规则\n工具使用预期\n项目特定说明\n不要在 SOUL.md 中过多加入临时项目细节。\n这种分离使系统随时间保持整洁：\n身份保留在 SOUL.md 中\n项目上下文保留在 AGENTS.md 中\n要点：稳定的团队需要稳定的身份和共享的上下文，而不是一个庞大的、混杂的指令块。\n步骤 6: 添加一个共享的团队参考文件\n这有助于维护一个记录人员名单以及代理如何协作的共享参考文件。\n例如：\n/home/neo/.hermes/团队代理.md\n此文件可以描述：\n每个代理的角色\n交接规则\n何时使用哪个配置文件\n每个成员的良好产出是什么样的\n这给你一个地方，来向自己或以后使用它的其他人解释这个系统。\n要点：团队参考文件使多智能体设置更容易一致地运行。\n步骤 7: 直接运行每个配置文件\n一旦配置文件存在，您可以单独调用它们。\n典型模式:\nhermes -p alan\nhermes -p mira\nhermes -p turing\n重要的是，每个代理都以自己的配置文件运行，并且具有隔离状态。\n这意味着：\n艾伦不继承米拉的写作时段\n图灵没有继承艾伦的研究记忆\n每个智能体获得更清晰的长期专业化\n要点：好处来自于实际单独使用这些配置文件，而不仅仅是创建一次。\n将个人资料与消息关联\n当你将配置文件与 Hermes 网关结合使用时，它们会变得更加强大。现在你的团队不再受限于单个本地终端会话。\n你可以将不同的配置文件作为不同的消息身份运行，远程监督它们，通过 Telegram 分配工作，并在聊天和任务中保持角色边界完整。\n这正是 Hermes 开始感觉不那么像单一助手，而更像一个运营系统的地方。\n要点：消息传递将本地组织功能中的代理档案转变为实时多代理控制界面。\n结论\n如果你希望 Hermes 更强大，就别再试图让一个代理做所有事情。\n构建一个团队。\n从协调器开始，添加一名专家，验证交接流程，然后再进行扩展。正是在这里，Hermes 配置文件不再感觉像一个功能，而是开始感觉像基础设施。\nTakeaway: the smartest multi-agent team is not the biggest one. It is the one with the clearest role boundaries."
  },
